Proton Drive icon
-----------------

The Drive product mark under `data/icons/` is official Proton AG artwork from
https://github.com/ProtonDriveApps/android-drive (GPL-3.0-or-later). See
`data/icons/SOURCE`. Proton, Proton Drive, Proton Mail, Proton Pass, and
Proton VPN are trademarks of Proton AG. This project is not affiliated with
Proton AG.
